  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to establish a sustainable afterschool program that works with youth in Monrovia and their parents to enhance their dance, academic and social skills by learning to dance, teach, compete, and contribute at a global level while empowering them to succeed through a holistic development approach.Objective 1) Students&#x2019; ability to learn to process, analyze and respond to sensory information through dance increased.Objective 2) Movement skills, concentration and physical control in artistic expression increased among youth dancers.</narrative>
